{"id":"atractivo","lemma":"atractivo","pos":"adj","rank":2088,"glosses":["attractive, appealing","engaging"],"ipa":"/atɾaɡˈtibo/","forms":{"feminine":"atractiva","masculinePlural":"atractivos","femininePlural":"atractivas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-atractivo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella es atractiva, pero habla demasiado.","en":"She's attractive, but she talks too much.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692440","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"speech"},{"g":"too much"}]},{"text":"Él es joven y atractivo.","en":"He's young and attractive.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"young, youthful"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Una modelo debe tener un cuerpo atractivo.","en":"A model must have an attractive body.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703668","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"model"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"body"},null]},{"text":"Eso te hace aún más atractiva.","en":"That makes you even more attractive.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"more"},null]},{"text":"Él es atractivo de cualquier manera.","en":"He is attractive in every way.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,6,"any old how"]]}]}